    ["<Assistant_Title1>鲁恩第一猹</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>剧情-支线剧情\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>完成支线《告解时间到》"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Loen's Number One Marmot</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Plot - Side Quests\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Complete the side quest \"Time for Confession\"",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>雾蓝薄纱・铃兰刺绣・淑女长裙\n清晨的第一缕阳光穿透薄雾，落在初绽的玫瑰与铃兰之上。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Mist Blue Tulle/Lily of the Valley Embroidery/Lady's Long Dress\nThe first ray of morning sunlight pierces through the mist, landing on the newly bloomed roses and lilies of the valley.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>您在副本中达到星辰之主段位，称号奖励已解锁，可前往称号界面使用。</>"] = "<M_Default>Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default>You have reached the rank of Lord of Stars in the Dungeon. The title reward has been unlocked and can be used in the title interface.</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻声）</>您今晚好像有心事？"] = "<P_Heart>(Softly)</> You seem to have something on your mind tonight?",
    ["<Yellow>放牧灵魂</>：穿戴者持续攻击主目标一段时间后，可将其灵魂剥离到自己脚下，<Yellow>10秒</>内触碰灵魂可将其吞噬，根据灵魂主人的类型，造成不同效果：\n吞噬非凡者的灵魂：对其造成<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</>点伤害，并通过囚禁其灵魂获得对应序列的一个技能，使用该技能会释放其灵魂：\n    战士序列：<Yellow>黎明铠甲</>；\n    歌颂者序列：<Yellow>太阳誓约</>；\n    学徒序列：<Yellow>星云咏叹</>；\n    观众序列：<Yellow>心理暗示</>；\n    占卜家序列：<Yellow>诡秘之境</>；\n    窥秘人序列：<Yellow>星光囚笼</>；\n蠕动的饥饿提升危险等级时，对应技能强度随之提升。\n吞噬怪物的灵魂：立刻粉碎灵魂，对目标和周围<Yellow>5</>名怪物造成<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</>点伤害，并给目标施加持续<Yellow>5</>秒的<Yellow>灵魂压制</>效果：buffdisc(*id)\n剥离灵魂效果每20秒最多可触发一次，囚禁的灵魂被释放之前，无法再次从其主人身上剥离灵魂。最多可同时囚禁<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?3}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?4}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?5}</>个灵魂。"] = "<Yellow>Shepherd Souls</>: After the wearer continuously attacks the main target for a period of time, they can strip its soul to their feet. Touching the soul within <Yellow>10 seconds</> allows them to consume it, causing different effects based on the soul's type: \nConsume a Beyonder's soul: Deal <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</> damage to it and gain one skill of the corresponding Sequence by imprisoning its soul. Using this skill releases the soul: \n    Warrior Sequence: <Yellow>Dawn Armor</>; \n    Bard Sequence: <Yellow>Solar Oath</>; \n    Apprentice Sequence: <Yellow>Nebula Aria</>; \n    Spectator Sequence: <Yellow>Psychological Suggestion</>; \n    Seer Sequence: <Yellow>Realm of Mysteries</>; \n    Mystery Pryer Sequence: <Yellow>Starlight Cage</>; \nWhen Creeping Hunger increases its danger level, the corresponding skill strength increases accordingly. \nConsume a monster's soul: Instantly shatter the soul, dealing <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</> damage to the target and <Yellow>5</> surrounding monsters, and apply <Yellow>Soul Suppression</> effect to the target for <Yellow>5</> seconds: buffdisc(*id)\n The soul stripping effect can trigger at most once every 20 seconds. Until the imprisoned soul is released, you cannot strip a soul from its owner again. You can imprison up to <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?3}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?4}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?5}</> souls simultaneously.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>猎杀时刻活动时间</>\n<Highlight>每日19:00—20:00</>开放；每周六、周日额外开放<Highlight>14:00—15:00</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>王城区域限时事件</>\n猎杀时刻期间，可在王城中心【异变营地】限时召唤<Highlight>命运人偶</>，击败后可获得猩红遗物材料。\n每周五晚的猎杀时刻开启<Highlight>10分钟后</>，即<Highlight>19:10</>，王城中心将刷新<Highlight>巨龙·投影</>。击退巨龙时，当前有效归属伤害最高的团队获得拍卖奖励。每次猎杀时刻活动中，每名玩家至多获得<Highlight>1次</>巨龙·投影的终末猎杀拍卖资格；已取得资格的玩家，本次活动内无法再次取得。\n除周五晚场外，其他猎杀时刻开始<Highlight>10分钟后</>，王城中心将刷新<Highlight>王城守卫者</>。击败王城守卫者后，完成最后一击的团队成员共享对应奖励。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>段位胜点双倍收益</>\n猎杀时刻期间，击杀敌对玩家可掠夺<Highlight>双倍段位胜点</>；被击杀时，损失的段位胜点同样翻倍。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Hunting Time event time</>\n<Highlight>Open daily from 19:00—20:00; additionally open every Saturday and Sunday from </><Highlight>14:00—15:00</>.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Royal City area limited-time event</>\nDuring Hunting Time, you can summon a limited-time <Highlight>Fate Marionette</> at the [Mutated Camp] in the center of the Royal City. Defeating it will grant Crimson Relic materials.\n10 minutes after<Highlight> the Hunting Time event begins on Friday night</>, i.e., at <Highlight>19:10</>, a <Highlight>Dragon - Projection</> will spawn in the center of the Royal City. When the dragon is repelled, the team with the highest effective damage contribution will receive auction rewards. During each Hunting Time event, each player can obtain the final kill auction qualification for the <Highlight>Dragon - Projection</> at most 1 time; players who have already obtained this qualification cannot obtain it again during the current event.\nExcept for the Friday night session, 10 minutes after<Highlight> other Hunting Time events begin</>, a <Highlight>Royal City Guardian</> will spawn in the center of the Royal City. After defeating the Royal City Guardian, the team members who land the final blow will share the corresponding rewards.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Double Rank Point Gains</>\nDuring Hunting Time, killing hostile players allows you to plunder <Highlight>double Rank Points</>; when killed, the Rank Points lost are also doubled.",
